        "反導函數：$\\ln|x+1|+\\frac{1}{x+1}$。",
        "代 $1$：$\\ln 2+\\frac{1}{2}$；代 $0$：$0+1=1$。",
        "答案：$\\ln 2+\\frac{1}{2}-1=\\ln 2-\\frac{1}{2}\\approx 0.193$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\ln 2-\\frac{1}{2}$",
      "claim": "INT(x/(x+1)^2,0,1) == ln(2)-1/2"
    }
